{"id":"u-15af82ba-aa70-4610-97d1-96e4eaf4baf7","src":"community","title":"Silver Era Full Body\nThe Secret for Muscle and Strength","author":"Mauro","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/silver-era-full-body-the-secret-for-muscle-and-strength-9","desc":"Muscle and Strength gains\n\nUsed Method of Progression:\n\nDouble Progression\n\nCompound movements: \n\nStarting at 5 reps  using a weigth that is your 10 rep max you will add 1 rep each week until you reach 10, then you will add more weigth, 2.5kg for one hand exercises and 5kg for two hand exercises and start over at 5 reps and keep doing the same\n\nIsolation movements:\n\nStarting at 8 reps using a weigth that is your 12 rep max you will add one rep each week until you reach 12, then do 12 for 2 weeks and add more weigth and start over at 8 reps\n\n\nThe program can be used indefinitely, the program is only written until week 6, after that just do the same as before\n\nDELOAD after week 6, deload doesn t count as a training week so restart the program at week 7","level":["Intermediate"],"goals":["Muscle","Strength","Women's"],"equipment":["Full Gym"],"minutes":80,"joins":67,"rate":4,"rateCount":1,"updated":"2026-07-02T15:47:48.158Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["Day 1","Day 2","Day 3","Day 4"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"Overhead Press (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":5,"rpe":6,"x":3}]},{"n":"Incline Bench Press (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":5,"rpe":6,"x":3}]},{"n":"Seated Row (Cable)","sets":[{"r":5,"rpe":6,"x":3}]},{"n":"Bicep Curl (Cable)","sets":[{"r":8,"rpe":6,"x":3}]},{"n":"French Press","sets":[{"r":8,"rpe":6,"x":3}]},{"n":"Reverse Bicep Curl (EZ Bar)","sets":[{"r":8,"rpe":6,"x":3}]},{"n":"Lunge (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":5,"rpe":6,"x":3}]},{"n":"Romanian Deadlift (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":5,"rpe":6,"x":3}]},{"n":"Seated Calf Raise","sets":[{"r":8,"rpe":6,"x":3}]}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Upright Row (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":5,"rpe":6,"x":3}]},{"n":"Lateral Raise (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":8,"rpe":6,"x":3}]},{"n":"Dip (Weighted)